OL,3,GNEWSAGovernment committed to a hate
OL,4,Acrime law
OL,5,
OL,6,FA minister says she is committed to
OL,7,Fintroducing a hate crime law in Jersey.
OL,9,FResponding to a written question,
OL,10,FJustice & Home Affairs Minister Helen
OL,11,FMiles said she intended to have a draft
OL,12,Fready for a vote in the Assembly by the
OL,13,Fend of 2027.
OL,15,FMiles said she would "consult with the
OL,16,Fpublic, victims, community
OL,17,Forganisations, and criminal justice
OL,18,Fagencies" during the process.
OL,20,FPrevious governments failed to create a
OL,21,Flaw, despite expressing a desire to do
OL,22,Fsomething about the issue.
